        {"id": "impedance-note", "kind": "note", "box": [459, 588, 1011, 613], "legibility": "LEGIBLE", "text": "Impedance between drawing and nameplate may differ. Measured impedance value will be indicated on nameplate according to production test results. Regarding this measurement impedance value, no revised drawing will be sent."},
